e","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"included when specifying clef lines and determining display-step \/ display-octave values, but are not counted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as lines for the purposes of the system-layout and staff-layout elements.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLLineDetail"}}}